    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>3级 伏击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 35；''重伤'' 17</span><span>''先攻'' +9</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 17，''强韧'' 15，''反射'' 17，''意志'' 17</span><span>''侦查'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">敏捷反应</div>\n<div class=description>该半身人对抗借机攻击的 AC 获得+2 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">欺瞒</div>\n<div class=description>当该半身人结束一个它未曾攻击的回合且它对一个生物拥有掩蔽或隐蔽时，它对该生物躲藏<br>直到其下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}短剑（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+8vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+4 伤害，若该半身人攻击时对目标躲藏则为 4d6+8 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/area}}烟雾弹✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：区域 10 爆发 1。爆发内的格子轻度模糊直到该半身人下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+12，运动+8，唬骗+10，盗术+12</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 14（+3）</span><span>''敏捷'' 19（+5）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 11（+1）</span><span>''智力'' 11（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 18（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，短剑，4 颗烟雾弹</span></div></div>\n</div>",
